.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
dist/
Inputs/**
raw/**
index/**
runs/**
tmp/**
# Entity content — keep only system files (schema/how-to + audit log).
# catalog.md (id→name tables), the entity notes, and decision ADRs are content
# and must NOT reach the remote.
entities/*/*.md
!entities/*/index.md
!entities/*/log.md

# Data payloads embed the entire dataset (names + emails) — never commit.
# The wiki-browser app shell (Apps/wiki-browser.html) holds NO data and is tracked;
# its data lives in Apps/wiki-data.js, which stays local. people-directory.html
# still embeds data inline, so it stays ignored too. scripts/ rebuilds all of these.
Apps/wiki-data.js
Apps/people-directory.html
